\fs30\b Enterprise Public Website & Administration Platform User Manual\b0\fs24\par
\par
â€¢ *Version:** 1.0  \par
â€¢ *Platform:** Dankamf Educational Complex  \par
â€¢ *Live website:** https://dankamf-eduplex.web.app  \par
â€¢ *Audience:** School leadership, admissions officers, content managers, administrators and support staff\par
\par
\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brsp20\par
\par
\fs30\b 1. Purpose of this manual\b0\fs24\par
\par
This manual explains how to use the Dankamf public website and its protected administration platform. It covers:\par
\par
â€¢ How visitors navigate the website and submit enquiries.\par
â€¢ How authorised staff review admissions, applications and messages.\par
â€¢ How superadmins manage school content, users, images and settings.\par
â€¢ How to format Markdown content professionally.\par
â€¢ How to troubleshoot common access, upload and display issues.\par
\par
This is an operating guide. Technical deployment instructions remain in the repository [README.md](../README.md).\par
\par
\fs30\b 2. Platform overview\b0\fs24\par
\par
The platform has two connected areas:\par
\par
\fs26\b Public website\b0\fs24\par
\par
The public area presents the school to prospective families, current families, learners, alumni and the wider community. Content is displayed from Firebase where the relevant section is dynamic.\par
\par
\fs26\b Administration platform\b0\fs24\par
\par
The admin area provides secure tools for managing school content and operational submissions. Access requires Firebase Authentication and a matching profile in the Firestore `users` collection.\par
\par
The canonical roles are:\par
\par
â€¢ `superadmin` â€” full content, user, upload, settings and security-management authority.\par
â€¢ `admin` â€” operational viewing and approved response/status workflows. Content publishing and file-management writes are restricted by the deployed rules.\par
\par
\fs30\b 3. Public website guide\b0\fs24\par
\par
\fs26\b Main public navigation\b0\fs24\par
\par
| Area | URL | Purpose |\par
|---|---|---|\par
| Home | `/` | Hero carousel, school introduction, highlights, academics, news, events, testimonials, gallery and calls to action. |\par
| About | `/about` | History, leadership, vision, mission, values, achievements and educational philosophy. |\par
| Academics | `/academics` and `/services` | Academic programmes and curriculum information. |\par
| Programme details | `/academics/:slug` | Full programme description, image, curriculum, assessment and timetable information. |\par
| School capabilities | `/school-capabilities` | Why families choose Dankamf and the schoolâ€™s capabilities. |\par
